.avif?t=1764696917\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3111010/extras/e3d4a73a8fad12b08822eb2eae82bb88.webm?t=1764696917\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3111010/extras/e3d4a73a8fad12b08822eb2eae82bb88.mp4?t=1764696917\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Diverse interactions aid in expressing and understanding the story. Includes a realistic surgery simulator, talisman exorcism based on the Five Elements theory, and side-scrolling exploration/escape—moderate difficulty, easy to learn, fully immersive.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Foreshadowing narrative elements is embedded; no malicious puzzles designed to frustrate players exist.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3111010/extras/720586d68db866fcfd3e85f5915bb804.avif?t=1764696917\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3111010/extras_big/720586d68db866fcfd3e85f5915bb804.avif?t=1764696917 width=1560 height=256 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3111010/extras/c06fd17fa785eeafb04dde8dc036f068.poster.avif?t=1764696917\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3111010/extras/c06fd17fa785eeafb04dde8dc036f068.webm?t=1764696917\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3111010/extras/c06fd17fa785eeafb04dde8dc036f068.mp4?t=1764696917\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game draws from traditi